        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Huffam, Mike Jefferies, Matt Barrelle, Craig Heaney\n- Works: The Martian, Johnny English, Game of Thrones, Goal!, James Bond, Mr. Bean\n- Roles: film producer, television producer\n- Companies: Buena Vista Pictures\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Huffam is a film and television producer.\n- Mark Huffam was a producer on The Martian, Johnny English, and the television series Game of Thrones.\n- Johnny English is a 2003 British-American spy comedy film that parodies the James Bond secret agent genre and uses comedy similar to Rowan Atkinson's Mr. Bean character.\n- Goal! was produced by Mike Jefferies, Matt Barrelle, and Mark Huffam, and Buena Vista Pictures distributed the film.\n- The Craig Heaney sentence is incomplete and only indicates that there was a 2009 sequel.",
